        "original_id": "28ee7149-ace3-5cd6-a50a-7105aa2c47df",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Public Television 19, Inc.\n- Organizations: CBS\n- Places: Kansas City, Missouri; Kansas City, Kansas; Union Hill; Blue Valley; East 31st Street; 23rd Street and Stark Avenue\n- Products: KCPT; KTBG; KCTV\n- Topics: studio facilities; transmitter locations; broadcast licensing; network affiliation\n\nFacts:\n- KCPT is owned by Public Television 19, Inc.\n- KCPT maintains studio facilities on East 31st Street in the Union Hill section of Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCPT shares its studio facilities with sister adult album alternative radio station KTBG (90.9 FM).\n- The KCPT studio facilities are adjacent to the transmitter tower of CBS affiliate KCTV.\n- KCPT's transmitter is located near 23rd Street and Stark Avenue in the Blue Valley section of Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCTV is virtual channel 5 and broadcasts on UHF digital channel 24.\n- KCTV is a CBS-affiliated television station licensed to Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCTV also serves Kansas City, Kansas.",
